{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Reign and Rumble",
    "steam_appid": 3734190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/c3773df86ef9ddd5f8201dca855af736.avif?t=1755244579\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reign and Rumble is a crazy, competitive party game for 2 to 4 local players (or online with Remote Play Together), where cuddly toys come to life to compete in hilarious mini-games. Create your champion, don your most absurd accessories, and get ready for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local or Remote Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're side by side on the sofa or connected remotely via Remote Play Together, Reign and Rumble is designed to make your friends laugh, shout and betray you at all times. Cooperate as a team... or betray them to get on the podium, even in a 1 vs 1 duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalise your cuddly toy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each session, create your own bespoke cuddly toy! Choose the shape, colours, patterns and unlock crazy cosmetic accessories (goggles, hats, capes, etc.) by completing special quests. The more you play, the better your style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/6058b817221d7b81c0999f31b0598d8d.poster.avif?t=1755244579\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/6058b817221d7b81c0999f31b0598d8d.webm?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/6058b817221d7b81c0999f31b0598d8d.mp4?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied, evolving mini-games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is unique thanks to a selection of mini-games with variations: the same rules, but with environments, rules or special events that change everything. From sliding through chaos on the ice to climbing an erupting volcano, the arena is always unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls accessible to all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reign and Rumble has been designed so that everyone can play. Each mini-game uses the same easy-to-learn buttons, whatever your age or skill level. The aim? To have fun quickly, without any headaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/f0c7e61470f31d5f7d38e1fe5cb57204.poster.avif?t=1755244579\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/f0c7e61470f31d5f7d38e1fe5cb57204.webm?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/f0c7e61470f31d5f7d38e1fe5cb57204.mp4?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master every challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to train to become the king or queen of the ring? Use the free mode to replay your favourite mini-games, discover their variations and fine-tune your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Etched in your memory (and on your hard drive)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each game, immortalise your exploits and those of your friends with a souvenir photo on the podium! Capture the funniest moments... or the worst betrayals (yes, we're talking about you, blue plush!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/7190f256c423d13c57fb2b66b7dd64fe.poster.avif?t=1755244579\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/7190f256c423d13c57fb2b66b7dd64fe.webm?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/7190f256c423d13c57fb2b66b7dd64fe.mp4?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dynamic soundscape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mini-game has its own music and sound effects to suit the action and the environment. Polar atmosphere, frenetic jungle or battle royale? The sound will immerse you in the atmosphere at every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your ideas, vote for new content, take part in events, and chat to the development team (and Gigi \ud83e\uddf8) on our community Discord server.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Linktree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/70ad0d652fbe4c185431ab82937df78f.avif?t=1755244579\" width=432 height=120 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/c3773df86ef9ddd5f8201dca855af736.avif?t=1755244579\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reign and Rumble is a crazy, competitive party game for 2 to 4 local players (or online with Remote Play Together), where cuddly toys come to life to compete in hilarious mini-games. Create your champion, don your most absurd accessories, and get ready for glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local or Remote Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're side by side on the sofa or connected remotely via Remote Play Together, Reign and Rumble is designed to make your friends laugh, shout and betray you at all times. Cooperate as a team... or betray them to get on the podium, even in a 1 vs 1 duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalise your cuddly toy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each session, create your own bespoke cuddly toy! Choose the shape, colours, patterns and unlock crazy cosmetic accessories (goggles, hats, capes, etc.) by completing special quests. The more you play, the better your style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/6058b817221d7b81c0999f31b0598d8d.poster.avif?t=1755244579\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/6058b817221d7b81c0999f31b0598d8d.webm?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/6058b817221d7b81c0999f31b0598d8d.mp4?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied, evolving mini-games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is unique thanks to a selection of mini-games with variations: the same rules, but with environments, rules or special events that change everything. From sliding through chaos on the ice to climbing an erupting volcano, the arena is always unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls accessible to all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reign and Rumble has been designed so that everyone can play. Each mini-game uses the same easy-to-learn buttons, whatever your age or skill level. The aim? To have fun quickly, without any headaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/f0c7e61470f31d5f7d38e1fe5cb57204.poster.avif?t=1755244579\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/f0c7e61470f31d5f7d38e1fe5cb57204.webm?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/f0c7e61470f31d5f7d38e1fe5cb57204.mp4?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master every challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to train to become the king or queen of the ring? Use the free mode to replay your favourite mini-games, discover their variations and fine-tune your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Etched in your memory (and on your hard drive)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each game, immortalise your exploits and those of your friends with a souvenir photo on the podium! Capture the funniest moments... or the worst betrayals (yes, we're talking about you, blue plush!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/7190f256c423d13c57fb2b66b7dd64fe.poster.avif?t=1755244579\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/7190f256c423d13c57fb2b66b7dd64fe.webm?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/7190f256c423d13c57fb2b66b7dd64fe.mp4?t=1755244579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dynamic soundscape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mini-game has its own music and sound effects to suit the action and the environment. Polar atmosphere, frenetic jungle or battle royale? The sound will immerse you in the atmosphere at every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your ideas, vote for new content, take part in events, and chat to the development team (and Gigi \ud83e\uddf8) on our community Discord server.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Linktree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734190/extras/70ad0d652fbe4c185431ab82937df78f.avif?t=1755244579\" width=432 height=120 /></span></p>",
